<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">one thing leads to another (and thus i met you)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After moving to Brightmoon and getting a new job at a coffeeshop to help out Razz, things were looking up for Adora. Besides her stubborn and strict boss who was hard on her, things were looking up for the bright-eyed girl. On her first day of work, she meets a quiet girl who immediately catches her eye, especially since the girl had two different colored eyes, you don't see that often! Flustered by the girl's beauty, Adora takes the girl's order and makes her drink, things were going well for her until she spilled the girl's drink all over her. That wasn't the greatest first impression and the girl stormed out of the cafe, leaving Adora embarrassed and ashamed. But, what type of relationship would the two girls make when they find out that they both go to the same school and live close to each other?&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>applesauce6</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Teen And Up Audiences</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
